msgid ""
"A pull or merge request will be created from a branch in the repository."
msgstr ""
"Pull request atau merge request akan dibuat dari sebuah branch di repositori."

msgid ""
"A push URL is set but no push branch is given. Set a push branch that "
"differs from the translated branch."
msgstr ""
"URL push sudah ditetapkan, tetapi tidak ada branch push yang diberikan. "
"Tetapkan branch push yang berbeda dari branch terjemahan."

msgid ""
"The push branch must differ from the translated branch when creating a pull "
"or merge request."
msgstr ""
"Branch push harus berbeda dari branch terjemahan saat membuat pull request "
"atau merge request."

msgid "A pull or merge request will be created from a fork of the repository."
msgstr ""
"Pull request atau merge request akan dibuat dari sebuah fork repositori."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"A pull or merge request will be created from the “%s” branch in the "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"Pull request atau merge request akan dibuat dari branch “%s” di repositori."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Changes will be sent as a Gerrit review request targeting the “%s” branch."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan akan dikirim sebagai permintaan review Gerrit yang menargetkan "
"branch “%s”."

msgid "Changes will be sent as a Gerrit review request."
msgstr "Perubahan akan dikirim sebagai permintaan review Gerrit."

msgid ""
"Changes will not be pushed automatically. You can still push them manually "
"from the repository maintenance."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan tidak akan didorong secara otomatis. Anda tetap dapat mendorongnya "
"secara manual dari pemeliharaan repositori."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Changes will be pushed directly to the “%s” branch in the push repository."
msgstr "Perubahan akan didorong langsung ke branch “%s” di repositori push."

msgid ""
"Changes will be pushed directly to the default branch of the push repository."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan akan didorong langsung ke branch default dari repositori push."

